  "name": "Mechanic's Drone",
  "type": "class",
  "img": "systems/sf2e/icons/default-icons/class.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your robot companion is linked to a Mechanic's exocortex. The robot ancestry and chassis heritage define its physical frame; this class grants its drone-specific neural link, Mechanic overrides, and class feat progression.</p><p>The drone has 6 Hit Points per level in addition to the Hit Points granted by its chassis heritage. Its key attribute is Dexterity or Strength, as determined by its chassis. Tactical Drone and Superior Drone feats increase its proficiencies when those feats are added to the class feat slots.</p><p>Commanding the drone normally costs 1 action and grants it 2 actions. Tactical Drone grants its independent 1-action Stride or Strike, and Multitasker grants the Mechanic a quickened action usable only to Command the drone.</p>"
    },
